ous anti-titan artillery  however once gabby succeeds in bombing  the armored train which held the  artillery  porco joins the fight and shields her  and falco from machine gun fire before  charging forward  decimating the enemy's defenses after  clearing the defenses  porco keeps advancing towards the enemy  killing several soldiers inside the  trenches and using his powerful jaw to  break the railways  after the armored titan is deployed  inside the fortress he destroys several  anti-titan artillery platforms in order  to protect him  he quickly retires and leaves the  remaining soldiers to the armored titan  and the beast titan  after the battle porco watches over  reiner as he recovers from his injuries  following the battle of fort slava  when reiner awakens he thanks porco for  saving him in fort slava  but porco coldly tells him that he only  wanted to keep marley from losing the  armored titan  porco then explains that he did not  inherit his brother's memories but he  did inherit  amir's memories and harshly berates  reiner for needing to be saved by his  comrades so often  including marcel whose death porco holds  reiner accountable for  reiner eventually leaves after piek  joins them porco later joins the rest of  the marlin military on the train  returning to their homeland  seated among the other warriors after  arriving at liberio  porco is seen helping colt walking since  he is suffering from a hangover  after entering into the internment zone  he is greeted by a man and a woman  porko is soon summoned to the warriors  headquarters for a meeting with zeke  on his way he meets up with piek who is  trying to walk on all fours to emulate  her cart titan  once the two arrive zeke informs them of  his plan to stabilize marley's steadily  waning power  by recommending the paradis island  operation to reclaim the founding titan  porco is unhappy at the news that the  noble tiber family will be  acting as the warriors spokespersons  during the affair but is convinced by  reiner and zeke to agree  to the plan porco quietly attends a  military meeting figuring out the  logistics of an invasion of paradise  island  after the meeting ends he joins his  warrior colleagues outside on a balcony  and sarcastically complements the senior  officers as wise  when falco overtakes gabby in a foot  race and cold expresses that gabby's  superior ranking will not change  corco calls the selection criteria vague  porco along with the other warriors are  instructed to take a seat before willy  typer's speech  as ambassadors to marley after taking  their seat a marley soldier informs the  warriors that mcgoth wants to speak with  them  after sending zeke off the soldier leads  porko and piek to an empty room  confused porco asks where magoth is only  for the soldier to cut a nearby rope  opening a trap door underneath the two  porco and piak fall onto a bed of straw  fracturing their bones in the process  piek identifies the hole as an  old-fashioned warrior confinement area  and they note the lack of space to  transform  porko wonders about the soldier's plan  piek answering that she is not sure  but recognizes the soldier from  somewhere the captive warriors begin to  feel tremors inside the confinement trap  this allows piek to deduce that the  titans are battling outside giving  reason to why they were captured  as porco begins questioning how to  escape the panzer unit comes to the  rescue  piek explains that she had taken  security messers because of the  suspicious feeling she had gotten from  their supposed escort  the unit then sends down a rope which  the warriors used to climb up and out of  the pitfall  the rescuers informed them about the  attack titan's sudden appearance and how  the warhammer titan is currently  engaging it in battle  will spiek briefs her troops porco  prepares to go and join the fray  though she asks him to stop and observe  the situation for a while  porco is then shocked to see a group of  soldiers dart over them using  anti-personal vertical maneuvering  equipment  having never seen it used before porco  eventually separates from piek and  after transforming into his jaw titan  joins the battle  he sneaks up on aaron jaeger's attack  titan from behind and leaps onto its  nape  distracting him and ultimately saving  the younger sister of willy from getting  consumed  forko then bites down into the neck of  the attack titan remarking that he has  always waited for the moment he could  retake the founder back for marley  when he is unable to bite through he is  left confused unaware that a soldier  had slashed the muscles on the left side  of his titan's face the attack titan  then smashes porco on a building behind  them  and as he sees the soldier maneuvering  around he fearfully realizes that it is  an ackerman  acknowledging the danger he is now in  porco tries to escape after chipping  away at the attack titan's arm  but is quickly struck with a thunder  spear this brings him crashing into the  ground  porco is soon surrounded by numerous  survey corps soldiers  he is bewildered that a bunch of humans  have been able to stun him while in his  titan form and are trying to kill him  he then realizes the soldiers attacking  him are the devils of paradise island  pxcart titan then arrives in time with  the panzer unit killing several enemy  soldiers with his machine guns much to  porco's surprise  as the beast titan also joins the  battlefield porco and px stand by its  side  facing the rest of the survey core as an  enemy soldier flies above the cart titan  ready to strike  porco spots them and leaps up in the air  he manages to kill the soldier to px  relief and flings the corpse away  he partially emerges from his titan and  warns piek of the ackermann as they had  lost sight of him  he listens as piek assesses the  situation and he states if they could  get the founding titan  the enemy would lose the ace up their  sleeves they are interrupted by a sudden  massive explosion of the harper  piek recognizes it as coming from the  colossus titan and realizes berthold was  killed and had his titan ability taken  by the enemy  angered by this porco once again charges  at aaron yeager remarking that the  enemy's plans  would be ruined if he gets rid of him  seeing another ackermann in his way  porco lunges at her as she reads her  blades to engage him porko is stunned to  see zeke's titan get taken down by levi  and then sees that the kart titan is  disabled as well fearing that both have  been killed  this drives him into a rage once more  and targets aaron growing out the claws  on his titan form  porco avoids another attack by mikasa  and lunges at the attack titan  only to get punched in the face despite  this  porco hangs on and bites down on the  hardened fist made by aaron  he then rakes the face of the attack  titan with numerous strikes one getting  deflected by the crystals surrounding  the younger sister of willy  porco momentarily retreats back to the  husk of the warhammer titan  noticing an incoming airship porco  realizes that is how the survey corps  plan to retreat  he changes targets but fails to see  mikasa who cripples his titan by slicing  through his legs and cutting off his  right foot  this sends borco crashing down in front  of aaron the latter subdues the jaw  titan by tearing off both its arms and  forces the crystal into its mouth  forko realizes the attack titan wishes  to use him to steal the warhammer titan  but is unable to stop it  he is forced by aaron to bite down and  break through the hardened crystal  killing the younger sister of willy and  allowing aaron to obtain her titan  powers  he is then slammed to the ground and  left unconscious by aaron who tries to  bite his nape and eat him as well  seeing this gabby and falco yell for  reiner to save him  eventually managing to awaken him reiner  appears in an unarmored titan form and  takes porco away from aaron before being  punched and knocked down  too aaron stops his attempts of eating  porko and fleas the scene with mikasa  some time after the battle finishes  porco sits with a recovered piek  drinking alcohol when reiner wakes up  porco asks him if he had had a nightmare  not waiting for a response he passes a  bottle to reiner wishing their current  situation was just a bad dream  porco later takes part in an emergency  meeting with magoth and the other  warriors  he is shocked to hear that zeke is most  likely working with paradis and deceived  all of marley  as part of the retaliation against  paradis porco and piek are sent to  infiltrate paradise's military the two  infiltrate the military headquarters  where aaron yeager is staying  and porco stands by in a survey corps  disguise while piek leads him to the  roof  once piek has brought aaron to the roof  of the building porco transforms into  his jaw titan form and ambushes aaron  but is unable to prevent  aaron from transforming as aaron  transforms porco uses the jaw titan to  shield piek and gabby from the resulting  blast  on px orders porco cuts off her arm and  uses his own titan to distract aaron as  she transforms  once piek has fled with gappy porco  falls back to a safe distance himself  as reiner engages aaron in his armored  titan form porco tries to attack aaron  from behind  determined to get revenge for being made  an accomplice in the warhammer titans  murder he avoids an initial attack from  aaron  but he and reiner are both skewered and  left immobile when aaron begins creating  hardened structures from the ground  porco manages to free himself from the  spike he is skewered on and tries to  attack aaron again  but is forced to retreat as eren creates  more spikes porco goes in for an attack  again as reiner grapples with aaron  but aaron easily smacks him out of the  air knocking him into a row of nearby  buildings  still out of combat he witnesses the  arrival of zeke to the battlefield but  manages to recover  he tries to attack aaron again but is  caught in the middle of a barrage of  stones thrown from the beast titan  taking porco down once again seeing  aaron try to approach zeke's beast's  titan  porco grabs the attack titan and bites  down on its leg only to be struck  repeatedly in the nape by the attack  titan's hardened fists  and left severely wounded as reiner  fights aaron  he yells at porco to wake up and assist  him when he reaches to grab porco the  latter receives the memory of marcel  telling reiner that he sabotaged his  brother in order to save him from  becoming a warrior  de porco's shock and dismay soon porco  realizes that he is unable to heal all  his wounds and exits the jaw titan  stumbling towards reiner and a newly  transformed falco grease  he states how he finally was able to see  his brother's memories  and is now aware of marcel's role in him  not being selected as the armored titan  11 years prior proclaiming that he will  always be a better warrior than reiner  porco allows himself to be devoured by  falco and transfers his power to the  young warrior candidate  porco is one of the many titan  inheritors whose titan is created by  amir fritz to defend aaron while he is  attempting to rumble the world  his titan attacks reiner using its claws  to slash his titan's face until connie  springer blows it away with a  thundersphere  in the middle of the fighting porco and  a handful of other inheritors are  reawakened in the path world by zeke  zeke asks porko and the other inheritors  to lend their strength to him  and his allies taking control of his  titan porco helps fend off the myriad  titans that are attempting to defend  aaron he and marcel save gene kirsten  and piek from being killed  and continue the fight until aaron's  nape is destroyed  thank you guys so much for watching this  video it really means a lot to us  we will see you guys very soon in one of  our next videos

